        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the best emergency lantern for a power outage?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most homes, a rechargeable LED lantern with a dimmer and USB charging, such as the Goal Zero Lighthouse 600, is the best main light. It lights a room at a moderate setting for nights at a time and can be recharged from a power bank, car or power station. Back it up with a battery lantern and a headlamp for each adult."
          }
