            If you only buy one item from this table, make it a rechargeable lantern with a dimmer and a USB port, then charge it every few months. If you buy two, add a D-cell or AA lantern for the closet. If you buy three, the third should be a headlamp, because the moments you most need light in an outage, carrying things, checking the basement, resetting breakers, are the moments you need both hands free.
